WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.467
It seems like there's so much going on right now.

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:05.234
Donald Trump, Joe Biden, now Mike Pence --

00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:07.067
all have classified documents in their homes.

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:09.634
The NFL playoffs are in full swing.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:11.133
The NFL this weekend.

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:14.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.400
Egg prices are soaring.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.567
And Dunkin' is making plans

00:00:19.567 --> 00:00:21.667
to offer their own alcoholic beverages.

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:23.701
[ Audience cheers ] There's a lot to go over.

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:25.367
Let's just jump in, cover it all at once.

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:27.067
It's time for a "News Smash." Here we go.

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:31.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:34.167
First up, the classified documents scandal.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:37.033
They just keep finding more. First it was Trump, then Biden.

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:40.100
Now Mike Pence. At this point, Americans are tired of it.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.968
They just want to turn off the news and watch...

00:00:41.968 --> 00:00:43.968
the NFL playoffs.

00:00:43.968 --> 00:00:45.367
This weekend.

00:00:45.367 --> 00:00:48.834
It's Bengals versus Chiefs, 49ers versus Eagles...

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:50.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:52.334
...for a trip to the Super Bowl.

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:54.834
The stakes are high. Almost as high as...

00:00:54.834 --> 00:00:56.434
egg prices.

00:00:56.434 --> 00:00:58.000
They are soaring,

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.567
and Congress might even investigate what's going on.

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:02.868
At these prices, instead of eating eggs for breakfast,

00:01:02.868 --> 00:01:06.634
you're better off... drinking booze at Dunkin'.

00:01:06.634 --> 00:01:08.267
That's right. Dunkin' is planning

00:01:08.267 --> 00:01:10.534
to sell its own alcoholic drinks.

00:01:10.534 --> 00:01:12.367
People were like, "Ew, what's even in it?"

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:14.334
And Dunkin' said... "That's classified."

00:01:14.334 --> 00:01:16.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:18.234
[ Applause ]

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:23.734
The papers -- The papers are everywhere.

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:25.467
This week, President Biden was like,

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:28.033
"I apologize for keeping documents in ma-garage,

00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:29.367
ma-office, and...

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:30.701
ma-homes."

00:01:30.701 --> 00:01:33.300
That is the Kansas City quarterback.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.234
And he's got to play Cincinnati's Joe Burrow.

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:36.667
Both of them are going to play hard.

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:39.000
Neither one is gonna just roll over easy...

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.601
scrambled, fried.

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:42.667
No matter how you make them, they're expensive.

00:01:42.667 --> 00:01:44.934
So if you've got a bunch of eggs right now, keep them to yourself.

00:01:44.934 --> 00:01:46.067
Maybe even...

00:01:46.067 --> 00:01:47.234
hide them.

00:01:47.234 --> 00:01:50.801
Mike Pence -- Mike Pence has been so stressed,

00:01:50.801 --> 00:01:52.634
he's thinking about doing shots over at...

00:01:52.634 --> 00:01:54.167
Drunkin' Donuts.

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:56.534
Seriously, booze at Dunkin'?

00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:58.767
Even people in Boston are like, "Sorry, but I think I'll...

00:01:58.767 --> 00:02:00.968
pass." That's the quarterback's job.

00:02:00.968 --> 00:02:03.601
And if they screw up on Sunday, their whole season will be...

00:02:03.601 --> 00:02:06.100
totally wasted.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.801
In conclusion, don't miss, kickers...

00:02:08.801 --> 00:02:10.367
stop it, misters...

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:12.234
penny pinch-ahs...

00:02:12.234 --> 00:02:13.767
wicked piss-ah.

00:02:13.767 --> 00:02:15.434
This has been a "News Smash."

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:17.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:19.133
♪♪

